flowchart TD
 W[Signed webhook / schedule trigger] --> V[Verify signature + deduplicate]
 V --> N[n8n workflow trigger]
 N --> A{Supported API exists?}
 A -->|Yes| C[Typed API connector + scoped OAuth]
 A -->|No| B[Isolated browser worker]
 B --> O[HTTPS origin allowlist + accessible locators]
 C --> R[Validate connector result]
 O --> R
 R --> P[Prepare exact high-impact action preview]
 P --> H[Authenticated human approval]
 H -->|Reject / expire| X[Stop + audit]
 H -->|Approve exact payload hash| I[Revalidate policy + idempotency]
 I --> E[Execute once via connector]
 E --> L[Persist result + redacted audit]
